## SQ-RM-15 | polished iron bars come from sandpaper polishing iron bars; the stonecutting recipe stays removed
@group A
@commands rdetail the polishing id and the removed Create Deco stonecutting id
@pass `creativeengineering:createsandpaperpolishing/polished_iron_bars` exists (serializer `create:sandpaper_polishing`, iron bars -> polished iron bars); `createdeco:polished_iron_bars_from_iron_ingot_stonecutting` gone
@fails `createSandpaperPolishing` missing from NCH (Creative Common older than G1); `kubejs_create` lacks `sandpaper_polishing`
@reviewed 2026-11-24
> cdevtest rdetail createsandpaperpolishing/polished_iron_bars
> cdevtest rdetail polished_iron_bars_from_iron_ingot_stonecutting
waitlog verb=rdetail text=polished_iron_bars_from_iron_ingot_stonecutting n= 30
expect verb=rdetail id=creativeengineering:createsandpaperpolishing/polished_iron_bars serializer=create:sandpaper_polishing result=createdeco:polished_iron_bars\b
reject verb=rdetail id=createdeco:polished_iron_bars_from_iron_ingot_stonecutting\b
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-RW-32 | IE's 7 vanilla stripped-log sawmill recipes removed, the pack's own stay
@group A
@commands rdetail `immersiveengineering:sawmill/stripped_oak_log` and `stripped_mangrove_log`, and the pack's `creativeengineering:sawmill/stripped_oak_log-oak_planks`
@pass the two IE ids gone; the pack's stripped oak log -> 6 oak planks + wood dust recipe present; JEI shows one sawmill recipe for a stripped oak log
@fails a recipe-removal error in `logs/kubejs/server.log` naming `bark.js`
@reviewed 2026-11-24
> cdevtest rdetail immersiveengineering:sawmill/stripped_oak_log
> cdevtest rdetail immersiveengineering:sawmill/stripped_mangrove_log
> cdevtest rdetail stripped_oak_log-oak_planks
waitlog verb=rdetail text=stripped_oak_log-oak_planks n= 30
reject verb=rdetail id=immersiveengineering:sawmill/stripped_(oak|mangrove)_log\b
expect verb=rdetail id=creativeengineering:sawmill/stripped_oak_log-oak_planks serializer=immersiveengineering:sawmill result=minecraft:oak_planks\*6\b
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0

## SQ-CP-04 | Organic Compost recipes take any compost dirt block in the dirt slot
@group A
@commands rdetail the four Organic Compost ids; client: JEI recipes for Organic Compost
@pass the two crafting and two Create mixing recipes exist; their dirt slot cycles dirt, coarse dirt, rooted dirt, podzol, moss block, mud, humus and silt in JEI; crafting one with podzol works
@fails `i.t_compost_dirt` unresolved (Creative Common older than G2b); the tag empty (Creative Delight older than G2b)
@reviewed 2026-11-24
> cdevtest rdetail compost_manual_only
> cdevtest rdetail compost_bark_manual_only
> cdevtest rdetail compost_mixing
> cdevtest rdetail compost_mixing_bark
waitlog verb=rdetail text=compost_mixing_bark n= 30
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*compost_manual_only\b
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*compost_bark_manual_only\b
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*compost_mixing\b
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*compost_mixing_bark\b
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
look hand: JEI dirt slot cycles the 8 blocks; craft one with podzol

