## SQ-GR-45 | echo, felsic ingot, dragon and air brake assemblies read the config; an edit applies after /reload
@group A
@commands boot; grep the server log for `[NCH.cfg]`; edit `[crafting.dragon_helmet] loops` to 3 and `[crafting.echo_sword] lavaMb` to 500; `/reload`; rdetail both; put the values back
@pass at boot no `[NCH.cfg] no ...` warning naming `ECHO_`, `DRAGON_`, `FELSIC_INGOT` or `AIR_BRAKE` and no `overridden` line for them; after the edit two `overridden` lines (`CRAFTING.DRAGON_HELMET.loops ... 2 -> 3`, `CRAFTING.ECHO_SWORD.lavaMb ... 250 -> 500`); JEI shows 3 loops for the dragon helmet and 500 mB lava for the echo sword
@fails `CEQConfig$Crafting$EchoPiece` missing (old Creative Equipment jar); the section lookup reads Creative Common's `CRAFTING` first and warns
@reviewed 2026-11-24
bootreject \[NCH\.cfg\] no \S*CRAFTING\.(ECHO_|DRAGON_|FELSIC_INGOT|AIR_BRAKE)
shell python3 -c "import re,sys;p='config/creativeequipment-common.toml';s=open(p).read();s=re.sub(r'(\[crafting\.dragon_helmet\][^\[]*?loops = )2',r'\g<1>3',s);s=re.sub(r'(\[crafting\.echo_sword\][^\[]*?lavaMb = )250',r'\g<1>500',s);open(p,'w').write(s)"
sleep 4
> reload
waitlog NCH\.cfg.*CRAFTING\.ECHO_SWORD\.lavaMb overridden 60
> cdevtest rdetail dragon_helmet_sequenced_assembly
> cdevtest rdetail echo_sword_sequenced_assembly
waitlog verb=rdetail text=echo_sword_sequenced_assembly n= 30
expect NCH\.cfg.*CRAFTING\.DRAGON_HELMET\.loops overridden: default 2 -> 3
expect NCH\.cfg.*CRAFTING\.ECHO_SWORD\.lavaMb overridden: default 250 -> 500
shell python3 -c "import re;p='config/creativeequipment-common.toml';s=open(p).read();s=re.sub(r'(\[crafting\.dragon_helmet\][^\[]*?loops = )3',r'\g<1>2',s);s=re.sub(r'(\[crafting\.echo_sword\][^\[]*?lavaMb = )500',r'\g<1>250',s);open(p,'w').write(s)"
reject verb=\S+ .*done=0
look hand: JEI dragon helmet 3 loops, echo sword 500 mB lava (before the values go back)
